B.bhp=new A.b6("Show-Cause Notice Response Strategy","Regulatory Compliance & Investigations","Develop a response strategy for a regulatory show cause notice. Analyse the allegations, applicable legal framework, evidentiary record, procedural defects, potential defences, and regulatory exposure. Structure legal arguments and recommended corrective actions.")
B.bgR=new A.b6("Patentability Assessment","Intellectual Property Strategy","Conduct a patentability assessment for [product/technology] under the Patents Act, 1970. Analyse novelty, inventive step, industrial applicability, patentable subject matter restrictions, prior art risks, and prosecution challenges. Recommend filing, claim drafting, and protection strategies.")
